sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant API
    participant CandidateGen as Candidate Generation (two-tower)
    participant Ranker as Scoring & Heavy Ranking
    participant Filter as Diversity / Deduplication Filter

    Client->>API: User home feed request
    activate API

    API->>CandidateGen: Fetch candidates
    activate CandidateGen
    CandidateGen-->>API: Return candidate set
    deactivate CandidateGen

    API->>Ranker: Score candidates
    activate Ranker
    Ranker-->>API: Return ranked list
    deactivate Ranker

    API->>Filter: Filter candidates
    activate Filter
    Filter-->>API: Return finalized list
    deactivate Filter

    API-->>Client: Delivery
    deactivate API
